17
00:01:21,640 --> 00:01:23,720
Personal life?

18
00:01:25,400 --> 00:01:27,520
You mean sex, right?

19
00:01:34,120 --> 00:01:35,960
Don't worry.

20
00:01:35,960 --> 00:01:39,000
I have plenty of options without you.

21
