Don't you think we're like two stray dogs

54
00:05:10,720 --> 00:05:13,000
sheltering from the rain under one roof?

55
00:05:20,080 --> 00:05:21,600
<i>Cut! That's a wrap!</i>

56
00:05:21,600 --> 00:05:23,560
