87
00:07:24,280 --> 00:07:26,280
Don't worry.

88
00:07:26,280 --> 00:07:27,920
Regardless of whether the news dies down,

89
00:07:27,920 --> 00:07:29,640
I won't break up with you.

90
00:07:29,640 --> 00:07:32,760
- About us...
- Is the 50 million thing true?

91
00:07:39,440 --> 00:07:42,440
Hey, it was just to ensure a clean break.

92
00:07:44,360 --> 00:07:47,120
I couldn't let the girl lose out, could I?

93
00:07:49,080 --> 00:07:51,480
