I've been missing you like crazy.

101
00:08:13,840 --> 00:08:14,840
Zhen Xin.

102
00:08:14,840 --> 00:08:15,960
Wait.

103
00:08:15,960 --> 00:08:17,480
Wait.

104
00:08:18,960 --> 00:08:20,920
