You're crazy.

121
00:09:18,444 --> 00:09:20,280
We have a full schedule of filming tomorrow.

122
00:09:20,280 --> 00:09:23,400
No matter how busy work is,
we still have to date.

123
00:09:23,400 --> 00:09:24,960
Right, darling?

124
00:09:24,960 --> 00:09:26,460
Hey.

125
00:10:30,440 --> 00:10:32,040
Who are you?

126
00:10:33,960 --> 00:10:35,560
Fuck.

127
00:11:37,555 --> 00:11:39,445
[Fang Chi]

128
00:11:47,000 --> 00:11:49,360
You said...

129
00:11:49,360 --> 00:11:51,760
If it weren't for...

130
00:11:52,760 --> 00:11:54,760
Being raped...

131
