151
00:13:51,173 --> 00:13:53,853
I didn't know
you were so good at sweet-talking.

152
00:13:55,440 --> 00:13:57,113
But this soup...

153
00:13:57,113 --> 00:13:59,793
I really did make it just for you.

154
00:14:02,240 --> 00:14:04,866
Because I moved in today.

155
00:14:04,866 --> 00:14:06,466
Really?

156
00:14:11,120 --> 00:14:15,000
To be honest,
I thought you were going to leave.

157
00:14:15,000 --> 00:14:16,720
Here, look.

158
00:14:16,720 --> 00:14:18,640
I bought this for you.

159
00:14:18,640 --> 00:14:20,760
