160
00:14:20,760 --> 00:14:24,900
So, I went to a luxury store
to buy this for you.

161
00:14:41,600 --> 00:14:43,320
And these...

162
00:14:43,320 --> 00:14:46,240
You prepared these for me too, didn't you?

163
00:14:50,160 --> 00:14:52,480
They're just some sleeping pills.

164
00:14:52,480 --> 00:14:54,640
They'll help you sleep more soundly.

165
00:14:56,200 --> 00:14:58,480
I mean well.

166
00:14:59,280 --> 00:15:01,760
As for those,

167
00:15:01,760 --> 00:15:04,400
