168
00:15:04,400 --> 00:15:06,840
You ruined me.

169
00:15:06,840 --> 00:15:08,960
But didn't you enjoy it too?

170
00:15:10,080 --> 00:15:12,240
How can you say I ruined you?

171
00:15:12,240 --> 00:15:15,920
I'm opening the door to a new world for you.

172
00:15:15,920 --> 00:15:18,000
If it weren't for me,

173
00:15:19,560 --> 00:15:21,953
would you and that doctor
have ever gotten together?

174
00:15:21,953 --> 00:15:23,453
Yeah?

175
00:15:29,226 --> 00:15:30,680
