176
00:15:30,680 --> 00:15:33,480
Why do you still come near me?

177
00:15:33,480 --> 00:15:35,800
Because you're so wonderful.

178
00:15:35,800 --> 00:15:38,220
So wonderful that I can't forget you.

179
00:15:38,220 --> 00:15:39,940
So wonderful that...

180
00:15:40,680 --> 00:15:43,240
I want to savor you one more time.

181
00:15:44,773 --> 00:15:46,640
But after that...

182
00:15:46,640 --> 00:15:48,280
After that time,

183
00:15:48,280 --> 00:15:50,400
you started becoming cautious.

184
00:15:50,400 --> 00:15:52,640
Not only did I not get another chance,

185
00:15:52,640 --> 00:15:54,200
I had to fucking watch

186
00:15:54,200 --> 00:15:56,600
as that doctor reaped the rewards.

187
00:16:00,240 --> 00:16:02,120
<i>Can you go upstairs by yourself?</i>

188
00:16:02,120 --> 00:16:03,960
<i>Yeah.</i>

189
00:16:03,960 --> 00:16:06,520
<i>Is it necessary for two grown men
to say goodbye like that?</i>

190
00:16:06,520 --> 00:16:08,960
<i>Do all rich people have some kind of problem?</i>

191
00:16:08,960 --> 00:16:11,480
<i>What's wrong with liking women?</i>

192
00:16:15,200 --> 00:16:16,640
Yes.

193
00:16:16,640 --> 00:16:19,520
We're from different worlds.

194
00:16:20,960 --> 00:16:22,840
You're in the sky.

195
00:16:22,840 --> 00:16:25,320
I'm in the mud.

196
