Actually, I'm very, very curious.

205
00:17:07,320 --> 00:17:09,393
Did you and him...

206
00:17:09,393 --> 00:17:11,793
have as much fun as we did?

207
00:17:12,920 --> 00:17:15,120
You're not even worthy of mentioning him.

208
00:17:21,360 --> 00:17:23,320
Is that so?

209
00:17:24,800 --> 00:17:26,680
It seems...

210
00:17:26,680 --> 00:17:30,280
I'll have to help you refresh your memory.

211
