220
00:18:23,280 --> 00:18:24,680
Too bad.

221
00:18:24,680 --> 00:18:27,760
I'm strong enough,
so before the drug kicks in...

222
00:18:27,760 --> 00:18:29,320
No...

223
00:18:29,320 --> 00:18:31,800
Before you take your last breath,

224
00:18:31,800 --> 00:18:34,440
I'll give you one last good time.

225
00:18:45,320 --> 00:18:47,000
Stop!

226
00:18:53,800 --> 00:18:55,480
Let go!

227
00:19:04,779 --> 00:19:05,920
Gao Zhun!

228
00:19:05,920 --> 00:19:07,600
Gao Zhun!

229
00:19:23,280 --> 00:19:25,580
<i>Cut! That's a wrap!</i>

230
