on social media lately.

238
00:19:50,960 --> 00:19:53,727
The film festival has sent me an invitation.

239
00:19:53,727 --> 00:19:55,320
The opening red carpet is in two days.

240
00:19:55,320 --> 00:19:57,155
The whole crew will walk it together.

241
00:19:57,155 --> 00:19:59,080
So, get your outfits ready.

242
00:19:59,080 --> 00:20:00,400
That's great news.

243
00:20:00,400 --> 00:20:01,546
I'll be right there with Zhun.

244
