256
00:20:30,680 --> 00:20:33,320
Understood. Mission accepted.

257
00:20:46,800 --> 00:20:48,880
Don't be nervous.

258
00:20:48,880 --> 00:20:50,380
I'm right here.

259
00:21:32,832 --> 00:21:38,452
[ORSYU Film International Festival]

260
00:21:39,440 --> 00:21:42,280
Sign closer. Let's put our names together.

261
00:21:42,280 --> 00:21:43,760
Is that appropriate?

262
00:21:43,760 --> 00:21:46,520
Shouldn't we keep some distance?

263
00:21:46,520 --> 00:21:49,120
Did you forget what Director Chen said?

264
00:21:49,120 --> 00:21:51,080
