Stop filming!

275
00:22:57,760 --> 00:22:58,960
Mr. Zhen, Mr. Zhang!

276
00:22:58,960 --> 00:23:01,960
Photos of you two at the cinema
late at night are all over the internet.

277
00:23:33,680 --> 00:23:35,280
Are you two in a relationship?

278
00:23:35,280 --> 00:23:37,002
Is it true, as the rumors say,

279
00:23:37,002 --> 00:23:38,160
that you fell in love while filming?

280
00:23:38,160 --> 00:23:39,760
Everyone, step back! Step back!

281
00:23:39,760 --> 00:23:41,507
Please give us a statement!

282
00:24:03,760 --> 00:24:06,840
Don't push! Move back!
Watch out for your safety!

283
00:24:29,160 --> 00:24:31,126
- Hello?
<i>- Zhun.</i>

284
00:24:31,126 --> 00:24:34,240
Why haven't you called Grandma in so long?

285
00:24:34,240 --> 00:24:35,240
<i>Grandma.</i>

286
00:24:35,240 --> 00:24:36,280
I've been filming.

287
00:24:36,280 --> 00:24:37,560
I've been busy, so I...

288
00:24:37,560 --> 00:24:39,120
<i>Oh.</i>

289
00:24:40,160 --> 00:24:42,680
They've been talking about you on TV lately.

290
00:24:42,680 --> 00:24:45,280
I saw it all.

291
00:24:45,280 --> 00:24:47,680
<i>Is it true?</i>

292
00:24:51,640 --> 00:24:53,840
<i>Zhun.</i>

293
00:24:53,840 --> 00:24:56,080
<i>I don't expect you to bring
great honor to our family,</i>

294
00:24:56,080 --> 00:24:58,080
<i>or to become someone famous.</i>

295
00:24:58,080 --> 00:25:00,600
<i>I just hope you can be safe,</i>

296
00:25:00,600 --> 00:25:05,560
<i>live a steady life, and be happy.</i>

297
00:25:06,360 --> 00:25:09,080
<i>But the way you are now,</i>

298
00:25:09,080 --> 00:25:11,080
<i>are you truly happy?</i>

299
00:25:11,080 --> 00:25:14,880
Grandma, I'm very happy right now.

300
00:25:18,520 --> 00:25:21,200
<i>Happy?</i>

301
00:25:25,080 --> 00:25:27,880
<i>I'm glad you're happy.</i>

302
00:25:27,880 --> 00:25:32,080
<i>As long as you're happy,
when I pass away one day,</i>

303
00:25:32,080 --> 00:25:35,160
<i>I'll be able to face your parents.</i>

304
00:25:37,800 --> 00:25:39,480
<i>Zhun.</i>

305
00:25:40,600 --> 00:25:42,900
<i>- Zhun.</i>
- Grandma.

306
00:25:45,400 --> 00:25:47,160
<i>Are you crying?</i>

307
00:25:47,160 --> 00:25:50,360
<i>Did Grandma say something wrong?</i>

308
00:25:54,640 --> 00:25:56,600
Grandma.

309
00:25:56,600 --> 00:25:58,520
You didn't do anything wrong.

310
00:25:59,720 --> 00:26:01,320
<i>Zhun.</i>

311
00:26:01,320 --> 00:26:03,960
<i>Ignore what others say.</i>

312
00:26:03,960 --> 00:26:06,400
<i>Everyone lives their own life.</i>

313
00:26:07,160 --> 00:26:09,360
<i>It's just that, regarding you and Dan Yi...</i>

314
00:26:09,360 --> 00:26:12,720
<i>Grandma, let me talk to him.</i>

315
00:26:16,040 --> 00:26:18,400
<i>All the neighbors are gossiping.</i>

316
00:26:18,400 --> 00:26:21,160
<i>I really can't stop them.</i>

317
00:26:21,160 --> 00:26:22,880
<i>I'm sorry.</i>

318
00:26:23,680 --> 00:26:26,040
Thank you for staying with my family.

319
00:26:27,440 --> 00:26:28,960
<i>Zhang Zhun.</i>

320
00:26:28,960 --> 00:26:31,400
<i>This is the second time.</i>

321
00:26:31,400 --> 00:26:34,440
<i>You're gambling with everything you have.</i>

322
00:26:35,600 --> 00:26:37,360
Dan Yi.

323
00:26:38,120 --> 00:26:40,080
<i>Come back.</i>

324
00:26:44,680 --> 00:26:46,499
<i>Grandma and I will wait for you at home.</i>

325
00:26:46,499 --> 00:26:48,179
No matter...

326
00:26:53,760 --> 00:26:55,600
No matter what,

327
00:26:57,000 --> 00:26:59,200
I won't be coming back.

328
00:27:02,440 --> 00:27:04,240
I'm sorry.

329
00:27:07,028 --> 00:27:10,617
[Grandma]

330
00:27:30,000 --> 00:27:33,507
<i>Mr. Zhen, blink if you're being
held hostage by this manipulative jerk.</i>

331
00:27:33,507 --> 00:27:36,200
<i>The way he's using this for hype is disgusting.</i>

332
00:27:36,200 --> 00:27:38,241
<i>Zhang Zhun's desperate
social climbing is pathetic.</i>

333
00:27:38,241 --> 00:27:39,821
<i>He's thrown away his dignity
just to get famous.</i>

334
00:27:39,821 --> 00:27:41,887
<i>Zhen Xin used to date only top-tier beauties.</i>

335
00:27:41,887 --> 00:27:43,407
<i>He must be blind to fall for you.</i>

336
00:27:43,407 --> 00:27:45,880
<i>Does he think he's gay
just because he's in a gay movie?</i>

337
00:27:45,880 --> 00:27:48,280
<i>Disgusting marketing. Boycott the movie.</i>

338
00:27:48,280 --> 00:27:50,054
<i>Zhang Zhun, get out of showbiz.</i>

339
00:27:50,054 --> 00:27:52,554
<i>Don't defile our dear Mr. Zhen.</i>

340
00:27:58,614 --> 00:28:00,482
[Comments (9999+)]
[Must be blind to fall for you!]

341
00:28:01,640 --> 00:28:04,400
I'll have my team suppress these comments.

342
00:28:05,240 --> 00:28:07,520
Just like with the 50 million scandal.

343
00:28:07,520 --> 00:28:09,120
Don't be afraid.

344
00:28:09,880 --> 00:28:11,800
The fifth of next month is your birthday.

345
00:28:11,800 --> 00:28:13,520
What do you want for a gift?

346
00:28:30,080 --> 00:28:32,080
Hello, Qin.

347
00:28:32,880 --> 00:28:36,280
Stop talking. I won't agree to it.

348
00:28:37,040 --> 00:28:39,800
Arranging a new fake girlfriend
for me right after a breakup?

349
00:28:39,800 --> 00:28:43,600
Is this PR move any better
than me seeing a movie with a man?

350
00:28:43,600 --> 00:28:45,560
What do you mean we won't work out?

351
00:28:45,560 --> 00:28:48,280
You are you, and we are us.

352
00:28:50,480 --> 00:28:51,960
That's right.

353
00:28:51,960 --> 00:28:53,840
I'm with him now.

354
00:28:54,520 --> 00:28:57,800
We're gay. Are you satisfied now?

355
00:28:57,800 --> 00:29:00,000
What are you doing?

356
00:29:00,000 --> 00:29:01,800
Coming out.

357
00:29:01,800 --> 00:29:04,880
I, Zhen Xin, own up to what I do.

358
00:29:04,880 --> 00:29:06,680
No. Absolutely not.

359
00:29:06,680 --> 00:29:08,480
Why not?

360
00:29:09,200 --> 00:29:11,440
Do you regret it?

361
00:29:11,440 --> 00:29:13,360
No.

362
00:29:13,360 --> 00:29:15,080
I don't regret it.

363
00:29:16,040 --> 00:29:17,120
But you can't come out.

364
00:29:17,120 --> 00:29:18,960
Why can't I?

365
00:29:19,880 --> 00:29:21,920
I can't be that selfish.

366
00:29:23,000 --> 00:29:26,040
I still have my grandma and my family.

367
00:29:26,040 --> 00:29:28,440
You still have me.

368
00:29:31,280 --> 00:29:33,280
Am I supposed to live off you?

369
00:29:34,960 --> 00:29:37,800
Do you have many 50 millions to spare?

370
00:29:37,800 --> 00:29:39,300
Zhen Xin.

371
00:29:41,440 --> 00:29:43,520
Aside from all that,

372
00:29:43,520 --> 00:29:46,000
I have to consider my family.

373
00:29:46,000 --> 00:29:48,440
We're living our own lives.
What does it have to do with them?

374
00:29:48,440 --> 00:29:50,680
This is between us.

375
00:29:51,320 --> 00:29:53,280
My father died young.

376
00:29:54,520 --> 00:29:57,400
My mom died of illness when I was thirteen.

377
00:29:58,880 --> 00:30:02,720
My grandma raised me in a small town.

378
00:30:03,720 --> 00:30:08,240
No matter how hard it was,
I never once saw her cry.

379
00:30:10,840 --> 00:30:12,920
But today, she and I...

380
00:30:18,160 --> 00:30:22,920
Anyway, I don't want her, at her age,

381
00:30:22,920 --> 00:30:24,680
to be unable to hold her head up in public.

382
00:30:24,680 --> 00:30:26,053
She'll get through it.

383
00:30:26,053 --> 00:30:27,800
Think about Gao Zhun and Fang Chi.

384
00:30:27,800 --> 00:30:30,040
They were in such despair,
but didn't they make it through?

385
00:30:30,040 --> 00:30:31,480
We can, too.

386
00:30:31,480 --> 00:30:34,120
That's fiction. It's a fantasy, a script.

387
00:30:34,120 --> 00:30:35,760
It's impossible in real life.

388
00:30:35,760 --> 00:30:39,120
The story is fake, but the feelings are real.

389
00:30:45,120 --> 00:30:47,440
You're too immersed in the role.

390
00:30:47,440 --> 00:30:49,640
I'm too immersed?

391
00:30:50,520 --> 00:30:54,080
Have you forgotten
who called me Fang Chi off-screen?

392
00:30:54,080 --> 00:30:55,960
When?

393
00:31:09,280 --> 00:31:11,280
Do you dare say...

394
00:31:13,520 --> 00:31:15,800
we weren't just acting?

395
00:31:22,920 --> 00:31:24,600
Yes.

396
00:31:24,600 --> 00:31:26,320
We were acting.

397
00:31:27,840 --> 00:31:29,600
There's one week left.

398
00:31:30,600 --> 00:31:32,760
Then, the movie wraps up.

399
00:31:34,360 --> 00:31:35,960
We...

400
00:31:40,600 --> 00:31:42,920
We should snap out of it, too.

401
00:32:11,480 --> 00:32:12,880
Come on, everyone.

402
00:32:12,880 --> 00:32:15,280
Let's review your performance
over the last few days.

403
00:32:16,440 --> 00:32:19,040
We wrap up in four and a half days.

404
00:32:19,040 --> 00:32:22,160
The remaining scenes
are all high-intensity emotional ones.

405
00:32:22,160 --> 00:32:24,320
Things have been a bit chaotic lately.

406
00:32:24,320 --> 00:32:26,600
You're both not in the right headspace.

407
00:32:26,600 --> 00:32:28,880
How about we add a table-read tonight?

408
00:32:28,880 --> 00:32:30,840
To get immersed...

409
00:32:30,840 --> 00:32:32,660
and find the right feeling.

410
00:32:33,280 --> 00:32:35,280
Director Chen, I have plans tonight.

411
00:32:35,280 --> 00:32:38,040
The table-read has to be
during the day or another time.

412
00:32:38,040 --> 00:32:39,920
Zhou Zheng, make the arrangements.

413
00:32:39,920 --> 00:32:40,920
Adjust the schedule.

414
00:32:40,920 --> 00:32:43,080
Let's do the table-read now.

415
00:32:43,080 --> 00:32:44,580
Okay.

416
00:32:46,800 --> 00:32:49,520
Turn to Scene 88.

417
00:32:49,520 --> 00:32:51,840
Let's look at this scene.
[Grandma]

418
00:32:51,840 --> 00:32:56,060
<i>Call Dan Yi even if you're busy.</i>

419
00:32:58,983 --> 00:33:01,171
[We've broken up]

420
00:33:07,920 --> 00:33:09,540
<i>Okay.</i>

421
00:33:14,783 --> 00:33:17,236
<i>I was wrong. I wasn't thinking straight.</i>

422
00:33:21,542 --> 00:33:23,167
<i>Let's do as you say.</i>

423
00:33:23,167 --> 00:33:25,961
<i>We'll be a couple anyway,
so you call the shots.</i>

424
00:33:27,941 --> 00:33:30,712
<i>Do you know what you look like now?</i>

425
00:33:30,712 --> 00:33:32,938
<i>Like a proud panther...</i>

426
00:33:34,402 --> 00:33:36,964
<i>desperately yearning for hugs.</i>

427
00:33:48,760 --> 00:33:51,820
Put your phones away. Table-read time!

428
00:34:02,080 --> 00:34:05,240
Are you just getting back
from an important event?

429
00:34:05,880 --> 00:34:08,240
I do have an important event tonight.

430
00:34:17,200 --> 00:34:19,720
Wait for me. I'll be ready soon.

431
00:34:49,480 --> 00:34:51,040
Zhang Zhun.

432
00:34:56,040 --> 00:34:57,800
Are you...

433
00:34:57,800 --> 00:35:00,120
willing to spend the rest of your life with me?

434
00:38:44,720 --> 00:38:47,440
<i>Is this how he is planning to confess?</i>

435
00:38:55,560 --> 00:38:59,069
<i>The passcode... could it be my birthday?</i>

